arch=x86
vmlinux_btf=7.0 kernel BTF dump (bpftool btf dump file /sys/kernel/btf/vmlinux format c, Ubuntu 24.04.5, 7.0.0-42-generic)
clang=Ubuntu clang version 18.1.3 (1ubuntu1)
load_verified=bpftool prog loadall, Ubuntu x86_64 7.0.0-42-generic, all 14 programs pinned;
  the provider's kernel tests pass with it on that host with the LSM d_path,
  LSM walk and kprobe programs, and on AlmaLinux 8.10 (4.18.0-553, LSM walk,
  cgroup v1) and CentOS 8.5 (4.18.0-348, kprobe, cgroup v1).
notes=rebuilt because bpf/rt_file.bpf.c and include/rt_event_contract.h
  changed: each program checks an optional per-handle file-name filter
  before resolving the event's path. Same 8 program sections and 14
  programs as the object it replaces; same header as the previous build.
  Current size is recorded in the check_files manifests.
